  user_input {
    user_response: "Create a clean, modern, and professional portfolio website for a Mechanical Engineer.\n\nPERSONAL INFORMATION\n\nName: Amal Shiyas\n\nTitle:\nMechanical Engineer | CAD Designer\n\nCurrent Position:\nApprentice Engineer at Wipro Infrastructure Engineering, Chennai\n\nCareer Goal:\nTransition into Automotive Design, Product Development, and Engineering Leadership.\n\nTARGET AUDIENCE\n\n* Automotive Recruiters\n* Design Engineers\n* Product Development Teams\n* Engineering Managers\n* Manufacturing Companies\n\nDESIGN STYLE\n\n* Minimal and professional\n* Dark theme\n* Automotive-inspired\n* Red accent color\n* Focus on engineering projects\n* Modern typography\n* Clean spacing\n* Portfolio-first design\n* Mobile responsive\n\nCOLOR PALETTE\n\nBackground: #0F0F0F\nSurface: #181818\nCard Background: #202020\nPrimary Accent: #D32F2F\nSecondary Accent: #EF5350\nPrimary Text: #FFFFFF\nSecondary Text: #B0B0B0\n\nDesign Inspiration:\n\n* Porsche\n* Apple Product Pages\n* Modern Engineering Portfolios\n* Formula Student Team Websites\n\nTECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS\n\nIMPORTANT:\n\nThe website must be deployable for FREE on:\n\n* GitHub Pages\n* Vercel\n\nUse ONLY:\n\n* HTML5\n* CSS3\n* Vanilla JavaScript\n\nDO NOT USE:\n\n* React\n* Next.js\n* Vue\n* Angular\n* Node.js\n* Express\n* Backend\n* Database\n* Authentication\n* APIs\n* Firebase\n\nThe website must be completely static.\n\nRequired File Structure:\n\n/\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 index.html\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 style.css\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 script.js\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 resume.pdf\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 images/\n\nAll images must be loaded locally from the images folder.\n\nThe website must work offline after deployment.\n\nWEBSITE STRUCTURE\n\n====================================\n\n1. HERO SECTION\n\nLayout:\nTwo-column layout.\n\nLEFT SIDE\n\nDisplay:\n\nProfessional Profile Photo\n\nImage Path:\n\nimages/profile.jpg\n\nRequirements:\n\n* Circular or rounded-square image\n* Thin red border\n* Professional appearance\n* Clean shadow\n* High visual prominence\n\nRIGHT SIDE\n\nDisplay:\n\nAmal Shiyas\n\nMechanical Engineer | CAD Designer\n\nShort Introduction:\n\nMechanical Engineering graduate currently working at Wipro Infrastructure Engineering. Passionate about automotive design, CAD modeling, product development, and engineering innovation.\n\nButtons:\n\n* View Projects\n* Download Resume\n\nSocial Links:\n\n* LinkedIn\n* GitHub\n\nMobile Layout:\n\nPhoto above text.\n\n====================================\n\n2. ABOUT ME SECTION\n\nTitle:\n\nAbout Me\n\nContent:\n\nMechanical Engineering graduate with experience in manufacturing and assembly operations at Wipro Infrastructure Engineering.\n\nPassionate about automotive engineering, CAD design, product development, and engineering leadership.\n\nExperienced in Fusion 360-based design and prototype development through academic and personal engineering projects.\n\n====================================\n\n3. FEATURED PROJECTS SECTION\n\nThis must be the main section of the portfolio.\n\nDisplay projects using large modern cards.\n\n\342\270\273\n\nPROJECT 1\n\nTitle:\n\nReal-Time Spatio-Temporal Pressure Mapping in Contact Mechanics\n\nDescription:\n\nDeveloped a low-cost pressure mapping system using Velostat sensing technology.\n\nDesigned a complete Fusion 360 enclosure featuring:\n\n* Sensor matrix integration\n* Electronics housing\n* Wire routing\n* Assembly considerations\n* Manufacturable design\n\nImages:\n\nimages/velostat-top.png\nimages/velostat-bottom.png\nimages/velostat-side.png\n\nDisplay images as a gallery slider.\n\nTechnologies:\n\nFusion 360\nArduino\nPython\nVelostat\n\n\342\270\273\n\nPROJECT 2\n\nTitle:\n\nFSR Pressure Mapping Enclosure Design\n\nDescription:\n\nDesigned and modeled an enclosure for an FSR-based pressure sensing system.\n\nFocus Areas:\n\n* Sensor placement\n* Mechanical integration\n* Wire management\n* Prototype manufacturability\n* Assembly-friendly design\n\nImages:\n\nimages/fsr-1.png\nimages/fsr-2.png\nimages/fsr-3.png\n\nDisplay images as a gallery slider.\n\nTechnologies:\n\nFusion 360\nArduino\nFSR Sensors\n\n\342\270\273\n\nPROJECT 3\n\nTitle:\n\nSmart Blind Spot Detection System\n\nDescription:\n\nDeveloped an automotive safety prototype using sensors and embedded systems.\n\nFeatures:\n\n* Blind spot monitoring\n* Vehicle safety application\n* Sensor integration\n* Embedded systems\n\nImages:\n\nimages/blindspot-1.png\n\nTechnologies:\n\nArduino\nPython\nSensors\n\n====================================\n\n4. EXPERIENCE SECTION\n\nTitle:\n\nExperience\n\nDisplay as a clean modern card.\n\nCompany:\n\nWipro Infrastructure Engineering\n\nRole:\n\nApprentice Engineer\n\nDepartment:\n\nAssembly Operations\n\nHighlights:\n\n* Manufacturing Exposure\n* Assembly Processes\n* Quality Awareness\n* Team Collaboration\n* Industrial Engineering Environment\n\n====================================\n\n5. SKILLS SECTION\n\nDisplay skills as clean cards.\n\nCAD & DESIGN\n\n* Fusion 360\n* Mechanical Design\n* Product Development\n* Engineering Drawings\n\nENGINEERING\n\n* Manufacturing Processes\n* Assembly Operations\n* Design Thinking\n* Problem Solving\n\nPROGRAMMING\n\n* Python\n* MATLAB\n\nTOOLS\n\n* Arduino\n* GitHub\n\n====================================\n\n6. RESUME SECTION\n\nTitle:\n\nResume\n\nDisplay a clean resume card.\n\nButton:\n\nDownload Resume\n\nFile:\n\nresume.pdf\n\n====================================\n\n7. CONTACT SECTION\n\nTitle:\n\nContact\n\nDisplay modern contact cards.\n\nInclude:\n\n* LinkedIn\n* GitHub\n* Email\n* Phone\n\n====================================\n\nUI REQUIREMENTS\n\n* Large project images\n* Smooth scrolling\n* Clean navigation bar\n* Sticky navigation\n* Minimal animations\n* Hover effects only where necessary\n* No glassmorphism\n* No excessive glow effects\n* Professional engineering appearance\n* Fast loading\n* SEO-friendly structure\n* Accessible design\n* Recruiter-friendly layout\n\nNAVIGATION\n\nHome\nAbout\nProjects\nExperience\nSkills\nResume\nContact\n\n====================================\n\nOUTPUT REQUIREMENTS\n\nGenerate:\n\n1. Complete visual UI preview/mockup\n2. Complete production-ready index.html\n3. Complete production-ready style.css\n4. Complete production-ready script.js\n5. Folder structure\n6. GitHub Pages deployment instructions\n7. Vercel deployment instructions\n\nThe final website should look like a premium engineering portfolio focused on CAD design, product development, and automotive engineering rather than a generic software developer portfolio."
    items {
      text: "Create a clean, modern, and professional portfolio website for a Mechanical Engineer.\n\nPERSONAL INFORMATION\n\nName: Amal Shiyas\n\nTitle:\nMechanical Engineer | CAD Designer\n\nCurrent Position:\nApprentice Engineer at Wipro Infrastructure Engineering, Chennai\n\nCareer Goal:\nTransition into Automotive Design, Product Development, and Engineering Leadership.\n\nTARGET AUDIENCE\n\n* Automotive Recruiters\n* Design Engineers\n* Product Development Teams\n* Engineering Managers\n* Manufacturing Companies\n\nDESIGN STYLE\n\n* Minimal and professional\n* Dark theme\n* Automotive-inspired\n* Red accent color\n* Focus on engineering projects\n* Modern typography\n* Clean spacing\n* Portfolio-first design\n* Mobile responsive\n\nCOLOR PALETTE\n\nBackground: #0F0F0F\nSurface: #181818\nCard Background: #202020\nPrimary Accent: #D32F2F\nSecondary Accent: #EF5350\nPrimary Text: #FFFFFF\nSecondary Text: #B0B0B0\n\nDesign Inspiration:\n\n* Porsche\n* Apple Product Pages\n* Modern Engineering Portfolios\n* Formula Student Team Websites\n\nTECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS\n\nIMPORTANT:\n\nThe website must be deployable for FREE on:\n\n* GitHub Pages\n* Vercel\n\nUse ONLY:\n\n* HTML5\n* CSS3\n* Vanilla JavaScript\n\nDO NOT USE:\n\n* React\n* Next.js\n* Vue\n* Angular\n* Node.js\n* Express\n* Backend\n* Database\n* Authentication\n* APIs\n* Firebase\n\nThe website must be completely static.\n\nRequired File Structure:\n\n/\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 index.html\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 style.css\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 script.js\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 resume.pdf\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 images/\n\nAll images must be loaded locally from the images folder.\n\nThe website must work offline after deployment.\n\nWEBSITE STRUCTURE\n\n====================================\n\n1. HERO SECTION\n\nLayout:\nTwo-column layout.\n\nLEFT SIDE\n\nDisplay:\n\nProfessional Profile Photo\n\nImage Path:\n\nimages/profile.jpg\n\nRequirements:\n\n* Circular or rounded-square image\n* Thin red border\n* Professional appearance\n* Clean shadow\n* High visual prominence\n\nRIGHT SIDE\n\nDisplay:\n\nAmal Shiyas\n\nMechanical Engineer | CAD Designer\n\nShort Introduction:\n\nMechanical Engineering graduate currently working at Wipro Infrastructure Engineering. Passionate about automotive design, CAD modeling, product development, and engineering innovation.\n\nButtons:\n\n* View Projects\n* Download Resume\n\nSocial Links:\n\n* LinkedIn\n* GitHub\n\nMobile Layout:\n\nPhoto above text.\n\n====================================\n\n2. ABOUT ME SECTION\n\nTitle:\n\nAbout Me\n\nContent:\n\nMechanical Engineering graduate with experience in manufacturing and assembly operations at Wipro Infrastructure Engineering.\n\nPassionate about automotive engineering, CAD design, product development, and engineering leadership.\n\nExperienced in Fusion 360-based design and prototype development through academic and personal engineering projects.\n\n====================================\n\n3. FEATURED PROJECTS SECTION\n\nThis must be the main section of the portfolio.\n\nDisplay projects using large modern cards.\n\n\342\270\273\n\nPROJECT 1\n\nTitle:\n\nReal-Time Spatio-Temporal Pressure Mapping in Contact Mechanics\n\nDescription:\n\nDeveloped a low-cost pressure mapping system using Velostat sensing technology.\n\nDesigned a complete Fusion 360 enclosure featuring:\n\n* Sensor matrix integration\n* Electronics housing\n* Wire routing\n* Assembly considerations\n* Manufacturable design\n\nImages:\n\nimages/velostat-top.png\nimages/velostat-bottom.png\nimages/velostat-side.png\n\nDisplay images as a gallery slider.\n\nTechnologies:\n\nFusion 360\nArduino\nPython\nVelostat\n\n\342\270\273\n\nPROJECT 2\n\nTitle:\n\nFSR Pressure Mapping Enclosure Design\n\nDescription:\n\nDesigned and modeled an enclosure for an FSR-based pressure sensing system.\n\nFocus Areas:\n\n* Sensor placement\n* Mechanical integration\n* Wire management\n* Prototype manufacturability\n* Assembly-friendly design\n\nImages:\n\nimages/fsr-1.png\nimages/fsr-2.png\nimages/fsr-3.png\n\nDisplay images as a gallery slider.\n\nTechnologies:\n\nFusion 360\nArduino\nFSR Sensors\n\n\342\270\273\n\nPROJECT 3\n\nTitle:\n\nSmart Blind Spot Detection System\n\nDescription:\n\nDeveloped an automotive safety prototype using sensors and embedded systems.\n\nFeatures:\n\n* Blind spot monitoring\n* Vehicle safety application\n* Sensor integration\n* Embedded systems\n\nImages:\n\nimages/blindspot-1.png\n\nTechnologies:\n\nArduino\nPython\nSensors\n\n====================================\n\n4. EXPERIENCE SECTION\n\nTitle:\n\nExperience\n\nDisplay as a clean modern card.\n\nCompany:\n\nWipro Infrastructure Engineering\n\nRole:\n\nApprentice Engineer\n\nDepartment:\n\nAssembly Operations\n\nHighlights:\n\n* Manufacturing Exposure\n* Assembly Processes\n* Quality Awareness\n* Team Collaboration\n* Industrial Engineering Environment\n\n====================================\n\n5. SKILLS SECTION\n\nDisplay skills as clean cards.\n\nCAD & DESIGN\n\n* Fusion 360\n* Mechanical Design\n* Product Development\n* Engineering Drawings\n\nENGINEERING\n\n* Manufacturing Processes\n* Assembly Operations\n* Design Thinking\n* Problem Solving\n\nPROGRAMMING\n\n* Python\n* MATLAB\n\nTOOLS\n\n* Arduino\n* GitHub\n\n====================================\n\n6. RESUME SECTION\n\nTitle:\n\nResume\n\nDisplay a clean resume card.\n\nButton:\n\nDownload Resume\n\nFile:\n\nresume.pdf\n\n====================================\n\n7. CONTACT SECTION\n\nTitle:\n\nContact\n\nDisplay modern contact cards.\n\nInclude:\n\n* LinkedIn\n* GitHub\n* Email\n* Phone\n\n====================================\n\nUI REQUIREMENTS\n\n* Large project images\n* Smooth scrolling\n* Clean navigation bar\n* Sticky navigation\n* Minimal animations\n* Hover effects only where necessary\n* No glassmorphism\n* No excessive glow effects\n* Professional engineering appearance\n* Fast loading\n* SE