  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Inspecting Requested Projects**\n\nI\'m now diving into the requested projects for the portfolio, focusing first on \"Real-Time Spatio-Temporal Pressure Mapping.\" I\'m reviewing the description of developing a low-cost system using Velostat sensing to gain a strong understanding for project section design.\n\n\n**Detailing Mechanical Enclosures**\n\nI\'ve been working on detailing enclosure designs. I created a full Fusion 360 enclosure for Velostat, covering sensor integration, electronics housing, wire routing, and manufacturability, for a pressure mapping system. Now, I have an enclosure design for an FSR-based system and a blind spot detection system. I\'m focusing on sensor placement, mechanical integration, and assembly.\n\n\n**Visualizing Project Components**\n\nI\'m now focusing on visual representations. I\'m excited about incorporating the generated images: velostat_top, fsr_1, and blindspot_1, to create compelling slide decks for each project. For the Velostat project, I\'m picturing an SVG wireframe of the enclosure\'s mesh bottom and a 2D cross-section diagram of the Velostat stack. I\'m also planning isometric wiring layouts and exploded diagrams for the FSR and blind spot projects, respectively, all with detailed visuals.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I am going to create the Featured Projects Section `/src/components/Projects.tsx`. It implements Project 1 (Velostat Pressure Mapping), Project 2 (FSR Mapping), and Project 3 (Blind Spot Detection). It embeds our generated images and couples them with highly creative inline custom SVG schematic drafts (Top, Side, Bottom, Exploded wiring grids) that act as the file slider images. It also implements a gorgeous tabbed CAD blueprint inspection mode."
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 3
      nanos: 679834545
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
