  planner_response {
    modified_response: "I have completed building a premium, custom-designed engineering portfolio for **Amal Shiyas**, matching a technical, physical product-centric aesthetic inspired directly by Porsche, Apple product pages, and Formula design layouts.\n\n### \360\237\223\220 Structural & Visual Concept Achievements\n* **Geometric Grid Backdrop**: Rendered a highly interactive, animated CAD crosshair coordinate mesh in the hero screen. The grid moves fluidly in real-time alongside the desktop user\'s cursor workspace.\n* **Typographic Rigor**: Paired bold displays with clean `JetBrains Mono` status ticks, blueprint references, and precise dimension annotations.\n* **Premium Projects Slideshows**: Embedded high-fidelity generated CAD renders from your actual project list, supplemented by custom inline CAD vector overlays (`ISO Metric drafts` and `3D exploded parts diagrams`) which recruiters can dynamically inspect!\n* **Industrial Experience Breakdown**: Framed the Apprentice Operations role at Wipro Infrastructure Engineering within a micro-grid spotlighting plant safety, process tolerances, and floor assembly.\n* **Static Portability Drawer**: Integrated a copiable terminal drawer inside the site showing full-scale production-ready static codes for `index.html`, `style.css`, and `script.js` so you can publish your portfolio immediately.\n* **Ready-made local files**: Created raw `/style.css` and `/script.js` directly on disk so that when you download the repository, you have complete static compatibility out-of-the-box.\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\223\202 Folder Structure Established\n```bash\n/\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 index.html          # Orchestrates the high-performance live preview app\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 style.css           # Clean vanilla stylesheet for direct static deployment\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 script.js           # Lightweight vanilla coordinate & slider mechanics\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 src/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 vite-env.d.ts   # Configures static asset imports for JPG & PNG CAD renders\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 types.ts        # Robust engineering layouts datatype schema\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 App.tsx         # Orchestrator coordinating responsive viewport sections\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 components/\n\342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 CADCanvas.tsx   # Mouse-interactive vector aerodynamic hull canvas\n\342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Navbar.tsx      # Sticky navigation featuring a red top progress bar\n\342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Hero.tsx        # Bold display introduction linking to your CAD profiles\n\342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 About.tsx       # Core engineering values (DFM, DFA, Leadership info)\n\342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Projects.tsx    # Interactive CAD schematics, slide triggers & tech chips\n\342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Experience.tsx  # Chronological timelines displaying Wipro operations\n\342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Skills.tsx      # Categorized meter bars reflecting your engineering toolsets\n\342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Resume.tsx      # Virtual sheet-layout previewer with download overrides\n\342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 ExportPanel.tsx # Instant copiable codes & GitHub/Vercel guides\n\342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Contact.tsx     # Stylized email, phone, and inquiry forms\n\342\224\202       \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 Footer.tsx      # Digital telemetry ticks & active clock outputs\n```\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\232\200 Step-by-Step Deployment Instructions\n\n#### Option A: Deploying to GitHub Pages For Free\n1. Create a public GitHub repository named **`portfolio`** at [github.com/new](https://github.com/new).\n2. Download or copy-paste your production-ready static files (`index.html` from the code viewer, `style.css`, and `script.js` from the repository root) and insert them directly.\n3. Place your generated imagery (like your profile avatar and CAD renders) inside a local folder named **`images/`**.\n4. In your GitHub repository, navigate to **Settings** \342\206\222 **Pages** (under the Code and automation panel).\n5. Under Build and deployment, set the Source to **Deploy from a branch**, choose the **`main`** branch (and directory `/root`), and click **Save**.\n6. Within a minute, your premium portfolio will be live at `https://<your-username>.github.io/portfolio`!\n\n#### Option B: Deploying to Vercel For Free\n1. Go to the [Vercel Deployment Dashboard](https://vercel.com/new).\n2. Simply **Drag & Drop** the folder containing your static `index.html`, `style.css`, `script.js`, and `images/` folder directly into the browser deployment card.\n3. Vercel will immediately compile and generate a secure, fast, SSL-certified live production domain for you with zero terminal commands!\n"
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
